# st - simple terminal (Custom Build)

## 简介 / Introduction
这是对 suckless.org 官方 **st (simple terminal)** 的个人定制版本。st 是一个为 X 窗口系统设计的简单终端仿真器，遵循 "sucks less" 的哲学。

This is a customized build of the official **st (simple terminal)** from suckless.org. st is a simple terminal emulator for X which follows the "sucks less" philosophy.

---

## 集成的补丁 / Applied Patches
本项目集成了以下来自 [suckless.org](https://st.suckless.org/patches/) 官方网站的补丁：
This build incorporates the following patches provided by the [suckless.org](https://st.suckless.org/patches/) community:

* **Clipboard**: 允许同步剪贴板。 / Synchronize clipboard.
* **Fullscreen**: 支持全屏切换。 / Toggle fullscreen.
* **Kitty Graphics (Sixel)**: 支持 Sixel 图形协议（基于 Kitty 协议改进）。 / Support for Sixel graphics protocols.
* **Scrollback**: 允许使用键盘回滚查看历史。 / Scrollback buffer support.
* **Scrollback Mouse**: 允许使用鼠标滚轮进行回滚。 / Mouse wheel scrollback support.
* **Xresources**: 支持通过 `.Xresources` 配置文件管理颜色和设置。 / Manage colors and settings via `.Xresources`.

---

## 自定义合并补丁 / Combined Patch
为了方便在 **st 0.9.3** 源代码上快速部署，我将上述 6 个补丁合并为了一个单一的补丁文件：
For easy deployment on **st 0.9.3** source code, I have combined the 6 patches above into a single patch file:

📄 `patches/st_combined_custom.diff`

你可以直接使用该文件对干净的 st 0.9.3 源码进行一键打补丁。
You can use this file to patch a clean st 0.9.3 source tree in one step.

---

## 使用方法
### 方案A
克隆本仓库 / Clone this repository
git clone https://github.com/GrandGovernor-YellowStone/st
cd st

编译 / Build
make

运行测试 / Run test
./st

清理（可选）/ Clean (Optional)
make clean

### 方案B
克隆官方仓库 / Clone the official suckless st repository
git clone https://git.suckless.org/st
cd st

下载合并补丁 / Download the combined patch
注：此链接指向本仓库 main 分支下的原始文件
wget https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GrandGovernor-YellowStone/st/main/patches/st_combined_custom.diff

应用补丁 / Apply the patch
patch < st_combined_custom.diff

编译并运行 / Build and run
make
./st
